description:
The explorer throughput sweep added in #2380:
- is not run on any schedule; only tests/uat/test_config.py refers to its config;
- returns 0 when its smoke phase is skipped, for example when node is missing (tests/uat/phases/explorer_smoke.py:55);
- calls test.skip in the spec when no throughput bundle is present (results-explorer/e2e/smoke/external-corpus.spec.ts:78);
- asserts streamValues.length >= 2 (:100) although 3 streams were requested, accepting the silently-dropped-stream defect it should catch.
